__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.sublime-workspace
docs/promotion/

# The agent scaffolding: the run-markdownglance skill is tracked, anything else
# a tool drops in .claude (settings.local.json, session state) is not. .agents
# is another agent's private copy of the same skill; keep one source of truth
# under .claude and do not commit a second.
/.claude/*
!/.claude/skills/
/.agents/
